notes:
  kira:
    title: Kira Thornwood
    short: Reluctant hero with innate fire magic, former blacksmith's apprentice caught between rebels and crown.
    long: |
      # Kira Thornwood

      **Age:** 24  
      **Role:** Protagonist, reluctant hero

      ## Background
      Former blacksmith's apprentice from the Northern village of Millhaven. 
      Discovered her innate fire magic when raiders attacked her village.

      ## Arc
      Learning to control her powers while navigating the political 
      minefield between rebels and crown.
    membership:
      narrative: protagonists
      political: northern-rebels
      magic: innate-users
  valdric:
    title: Lord Valdric
    short: Grand Inquisitor who seeks to control or eliminate all magic users.
    long: |
      # Lord Valdric Ashmore

      **Age:** 52  
      **Role:** Primary Antagonist

      Grand Inquisitor of the Crown. Believes magic users are 
      abominations that must be controlled or eliminated.
    membership:
      narrative: antagonists
      political: inquisition
      magic: null
  elena:
    title: Elena Brightwater
    short: Court mage secretly aiding the rebellion; Kira's magic mentor.
    long: |
      # Elena Brightwater

      Court mage who secretly sympathizes with the rebellion.
      Teaches Kira to control her abilities.
    membership:
      narrative: supporting
      political: royal-court
      magic: scholars
  marcus:
    title: Marcus the Red
    short: Pragmatic rebel commander who views Kira's power as the key to winning.
    long: |
      # Marcus the Red

      Leader of the Northern Rebellion. Pragmatic commander 
      who sees Kira's power as key to victory.
    membership:
      narrative: supporting
      political: northern-rebels
      magic: null
  temple-amulet:
    title: The Ember Heart
    short: Ancient artifact that massively amplifies fire magic; sought by both factions.
    long: |
      # The Ember Heart

      Ancient artifact said to amplify fire magic tenfold.
      Both sides race to find it.
    membership:
      narrative: null
      political: null
      magic: artificers
  firestone:
    title: Firestone Magic
    short: Emotion-driven fire magic system where passion must be balanced against self-destruction.
    long: |
      # Firestone Magic System

      Magic flows from emotional intensity. Fire users must 
      balance passion with control or risk self-immolation.
    membership:
      narrative: null
      political: null
      magic: innate-users
